<title>USA: Microware sees Q1 net loss of $2 mln.</title>
<headline>Microware sees Q1 net loss of $2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microware Systems Corp said Thursday its estimated net loss for the fiscal 1998 first quarter ended June 30 is $2 million and cited lower-than-anticipated sales to large customers for the loss.</p>
<p>The software company also said estimated revenues for the quarter were $4 million, down from $6.8 million a year ago.</p>
